      "id": "playbook/renewals",
      "title": "Renewal Outreach Playbook",
      "content": "## Who to contact\nOutreach goes to the account's primary contact only. Secondary contacts are not to be emailed as part of a renewal campaign; the primary contact decides who else to loop in on their side.\n\n## Tracking\nEvery outreach must be tracked by a ticket on the sales team at priority P2, linked to the account, so the renewal shows up on the pipeline board. One ticket per account.\n\n## What the email should do\nName the account, state the actual renewal date, and ask for a specific next step — a scheduled call before the renewal date. Do not quote pricing; the account executive handles commercials on the call.",
